# Not part of the chart package. Two Helm rules to keep in mind here:
# - a pattern without "/" matches a file of that name in ANY folder, so "secrets*.yaml" would
#   also hide templates/secrets.yaml; the files are therefore named exactly.
# - no "!" lines: in Helm (unlike git) a "!" line hides every file that does not match it.
secrets.prod.yaml
secrets.local.yaml
secrets.example.yaml
README.md
